          "short": "$g(t)=4t^2-8t+3$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}g(t)&=(2t-1)^2-2(2t-1)\\\\g(t)&=4t^2-4t+1-4t+2\\\\g(t)&=4t^2-8t+3.\\end{align*}$$",
