        "answer": {
          "short": "$f(t)=3-t$ or $f(t)=t-1$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}[f(t)]^2-2f(t)&=t^2-4t+3\\\\{}[f(t)-1]^2&=(t-2)^2\\\\f(t)&=1\\pm(t-2)\\\\f(t)&=t-1\\text{ or }3-t.\\end{align*}$$",
